      ],
      "text": "The repo is a Turborepo/npm-workspaces monorepo: apps/web (SvelteKit site), nehemiahd (Go host daemon), packages/sdk (Effect-native TypeScript client), packages/mcp, and infra/latitude provisioning."
    },
