        "slc_da7400870965a372bb7b53b8de3fb04f477da2d7653fea6173df357a40c6fae5"
      ],
      "text": "Each machine is a hardware-virtualized Firecracker microVM with its own kernel, jailed and resource-capped, restored from a memory snapshot in milliseconds, with guests network-isolated behind an egress firewall."
    },
