        "slc_9ec6fe1c2be48ec60b42715595a7941de2f97833a97a110eee3aa9377f39067f"
      ],
      "text": "Managed machines move through persisted lifecycle states (requested, placing, starting, running, stopping, stopped, failed, lost); terminal records never regress, and a machine declared lost is never presented as recovered."
    },
