        "slc_fc28d9677c261f7075c7b0af37db4d808a668190b0ea1210e844aa919c758321"
      ],
      "text": "File access uses capability-scoped session tokens sent only as bearer headers; query tokens, cookies, and redirects are forbidden, uploads are capped at 16 MiB, and sessions can be revoked with a typed DELETE endpoint."
    },
