        "slc_3fbeee25785b4127a9a7c5e0df5f0f68adf41807db62233824ba05dfa4bf9574"
      ],
      "text": "Managed OCI image import/pull is not implemented: requests receive a typed 501 not_supported response, and the field is documented only as a deprecated reserved field."
    },
